        normalizedCircleFinePacketProfile q m Γ x‖) ≤
      C * δ⁻¹ * (Finset.Iic (K,N)).sup (fun p => SchwartzMap.seminorm Complex p.1 p.2)
        (normalizedCircleFinePacketProfile q m Γ) := by
